# The same four-unit sell, with one order re-sent before it arrives.
# A modify is a cancel and replace, so re-sending order 1 at the same price and
# the same size moves it behind order 2 and the fills reverse.
ADD 1 BUY 100 3
ADD 2 BUY 100 2
ADD 3 BUY 99 2
MODIFY 1 100 3
ADD 4 SELL 101 3
ADD 5 SELL 102 2
ADD 6 SELL 100 4
